<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.10.10">
<l>kūṭi nīrai kaṭainta vāṟu mamutan tēva ruṇṇa vacurarai</l>
<l>vīṭum vaṇṇaṅka ḷēceytu pōṉa vittakamu</l>
<l>mūṭu pukkeṉa tāviyai yurukki yuṇṭiṭu kiṉṟa niṉṟaṉṉai</l>
<l>nāṭum vaṇṇañ collāy naccunā kaṇaiyāṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>You on the coveted serpent bed, tell [me] a manner in which</l>
<l>to seek you out who melted [and] absorbed my soul when</l> 
<l>the way [you] jointly churned the water and the skill with which [you] went</l>
<l>acting in a manner that the Asuras were destroyed when the gods ate the ambrosia</l>
	<l>entered into [it].</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
